    'cd.word.ok': 'Word file created and opened', 'ar.err': 'I cannot build the list of recordings (the files are there). Send a photo of this message to support.', 'dx.taglia': 'Cut', 'dx.copia': 'Copy', 'dx.incolla': 'Paste', 'dx.tutto': 'Select all', 'dv.h': 'Where I transcribe', 'dv.qui.t': 'On the PC', 'dv.qui': 'Free. The audio never leaves the PC. Ready a couple of minutes after the end.', 'dv.srv.t': 'On the server (fast)', 'dv.srv': 'An hour of lecture in about a minute, even on a slow PC. A few cents per hour on your RunPod account. The audio goes to the server (in Europe) and is deleted when the work is done.', 'dv.cod': 'Server code (Endpoint ID)', 'dv.chiave': 'RunPod key', 'dv.chiave.s': 'It stays only on this PC, protected.', 'dv.chiave.gia': 'already saved: leave it empty to test again', 'dv.vai': 'Connect and test', 'dv.via': 'Disconnect the server…', 'dv.via.si': 'Yes, disconnect', 'dv.via.t': 'Disconnect the server?', 'dv.via.s': 'Code and key are deleted from this PC. To use the server again you will have to enter them again. If you just want to transcribe on the PC for a while, choose «On the PC» in the menu: no need to disconnect.', 'dv.cosa': 'What is the server? A very powerful rented computer (RunPod, in Europe) that transcribes instead of the PC: an hour of lecture in about a minute. You only pay for the time it works, a few cents per hour of lecture. The audio is deleted as soon as it is done.', 'dv.altre': 'More options', 'dv.qui.b': 'Free, the audio never leaves the PC', 'dv.srv.b': 'An hour of lecture in about a minute', 'dv.quistato': 'I transcribe here (the server stays connected, for when you want it)', 'dv.nota': 'If there is no internet or the server does not answer, I transcribe here as before: the recording is never lost.', 'dv.lav': 'Testing the server… (if it was off it can take up to a minute)', 'dv.ok': '✓ Connected: test done in {s} seconds, cost about {c} cents', 'dv.attivo': '✓ Connected: I transcribe on the server', 'fn.spesa.srv': ' · server transcription about {c} cents', 'cd.manda': 'WhatsApp and other apps', 'cd.manda.s': 'the PDF, wherever you want', 'cd.em.apri': 'Open the email', 'cd.cal.tel': 'Add to calendar', 'cd.cal.ok.tel': 'Save each appointment in the calendar ({n})', 'cd.gdocs.ok': '«{f}» is in the «Verba Manent IA» folder of your Google Drive: open it on drive.google.com and choose «Open with Google Docs».',
